as it was once  normal for animals to be caged and  paraded through a circus these practices  are now frowned down upon by modern folk  so it makes sense that the live-action  remake would end with mrs. jumbo and  Dumbo being released into the wild where  they belong  although the original and the remake are  very different they have one thing in  common and exceptionally adorable  elephant who reminds us to embrace our  differences what did you guys think  about the new and improved Dumbo what  are the differences did you spot out let  us know in the comment section below  before you go give this video a big  thumbs up and don't forget to hit that  subscribe button if you haven't already  thanks for watching the things we'll see  you next time  [Music]
 

